# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source media — masters, not build inputs.
# These folders hold ~2.4 GB of raw footage and stills, including five files
# over GitHub's hard 100 MB per-file limit, which would make the push fail.
# The cut clips and web-sized photos the site actually loads live in public/
# and ARE tracked. Keep the masters backed up somewhere that is not git.
